Original commit body from 7394964:

Add YAML-driven pattern files to replace legacy _detect_* functions:

Python:
- tornado.yaml: RequestHandler, WebSocketHandler
- aiohttp.yaml: RouteTableDef, Views, middleware

Node.js:
- fastify.yaml: routes, hooks, plugins, WebSocket

Ruby:
- grape.yaml: Grape API routes, entities, helpers

Elixir:
- plug.yaml: Plug.Router, Plug.Builder, Ecto

Java/Kotlin:
- micronaut.yaml: @Controller, @Get, messaging, gRPC
- ktor.yaml: routing DSL, WebSocket, middleware

Swift:
- vapor.yaml: RouteCollection, Middleware, Fluent ORM

PHP:
- slim.yaml: PSR-7 routes, middleware, actions

Cross-language:
- graphql.yaml: JS/TS GraphQL servers
- graphql-python.yaml: Strawberry, Ariadne, Graphene
- graphql-ruby.yaml: graphql-ruby gem
- electron.yaml: IPC handlers, contextBridge, BrowserWindow
- cli.yaml: Python Click/Typer/Fire
- cli-js.yaml: Commander.js, yargs, oclif
- cli-rust.yaml: clap, structopt, argh
- cli-go.yaml: Cobra, urfave/cli, kong
- cli-ruby.yaml: Thor, GLI, OptionParser

Also adds RUBY_FRAMEWORKS and ELIXIR_FRAMEWORKS mappings
to profile.py for Gemfile and mix.exs detection.

Spec now documents 37 framework pattern files (up from 18).
